ro tether (EUR₮) as an ERC-20 token, and added in 2020 United States dollar tether (USD₮) as a TRC-20 token on the TRON network.","section":"History / 2015–2016","page":"tether","kind":"data","price_yes_ppm":265124,"cost_up_10_micro":"438816","cost_down_10_micro":"1420499","status":"Open","outcome":null,"provisional":null,"trades":2,"volume_micro":"2100000","price_yes":0.265124,"volume_usd":2.1,"b_micro":"3000000","movers":[{"trader":"seed-b","side":"no","amountUsd":2,"priceBefore":0.516391,"priceAfter":0.265124,"txHash":"DUjuB5EVndFLg9CTWvTcvpjmr1SCbn7iSzwcZE5bM917","at":1793871082341},{"trader":"seed-a","side":"yes","amountUsd":0.1,"priceBefore":0.5,"priceAfter":0.516391,"txHash":null,"at":1793870984341}]},{"id":8,"text":"As of July 2021, Tether is tied to half of all bitcoin trades.","section":"History / 2019–2023","page":"tether","kind":"data","price_yes_ppm":516391,"cost_up_10_micro":"694960","cost_down_10_micro":"645717","status":"Open","outcome":null,"provisional":null,"trades":1,"volume_micro":"100000","price_yes":0.516391,"volume_usd":0.1,"b_micro":"3000000","movers":[{"trader":"seed-a","side":"yes","amountUsd":0.1,"priceBefore":0.5,"priceAfter":0.516391,"txHash":null,"at":1793870991341}]},{"id":9,"text":"As of September 2024, the Tether-initiated T3 Financial Crime Unit had frozen about $12 million in USDT linked to scams and fraud, and had identified eleven victims.","section":"History / 2024","page":"tether","kind":"data","price_yes_ppm":516391,"cost_up_10_micro":"694960","cost_down_10_micro":"645717","status":"Open","outcome":null,"provisional":null,"trades":1,"volume_micro":"100000","price_yes":0.516391,"volume_usd":0.1,"b_micro":"3000000","movers":[{"trader":"seed-a","side":"yes","amountUsd":0.1,"priceBefore":0.5,"priceAfter":0.516391,"txHash":null,"at":1793870998341}]},{"id":10,"text":"Cantor Fitzgerald serves as its reserve custodian and preferred primary dealer.","section":"History / 2025–present","page":"tether","kind":"data","price_yes_ppm":51639